1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,914
@StadiumScene
{Music:Play|name=stadium_crowd|fadeIn=1.0|baseVolume=0.26|endTime=277.0}
{Position:Reporter|x=5.8|z=-50.8|face=Zorak}
{Position:Cameraman|x=7.0|z=-48.7|face=Reporter}
{Position:Cameraman2|x=6.7|z=-53.0|face=Reporter}
{Position:Cameraman3|x=4.6|z=-47.2|face=Zorak}
{Position:Zorak|x=-1.83|z=-50.7|face=forward}
{Position:Klaw|x=-0.61|z=-50.7|face=forward}
{Position:Vex|x=0.61|z=-50.7|face=forward}
{Position:Rex|x=1.83|z=-50.7|face=forward}
{Position:DiscoWorm|x=3.05|z=-50.7|face=forward}
{Zorak}{FaceHappy}
{Klaw}{FaceHappy}
{Vex}{FaceHappy}
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceHappy}
[Reporter] 欢迎收看第一届星际跨栏大赛！五位选手，十个栏架，零个规则讲解员！
{Camera:Static|position=7.8,3.0,-44.0|lookAt=0,1.0,-50.5}

2
00:00:06,214 --> 00:00:09,694
{Music:Play|name=interview_calm|fadeIn=1.0|baseVolume=0.16|endTime=129.6}
[Reporter] 首先，来自星际探险队的泽拉克队长！
{Zorak}{WaveHand}
{Zorak}{FaceDetermined}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=3.7,1.85,-48.1|lookAt=5.75,1.08,-50.8}

3
00:00:09,994 --> 00:00:21,730
[Zorak] 我的策略很简单——把每个栏架当成未知星系的边界，跨越它，然后...假装没绊倒。不过说实话，我主要是来监督队员们的。
{Zorak}{PointForward}
{Zorak}{FaceDetermined}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=1.7,1.75,-48.4|lookAt=-1.83,1.05,-50.7}

4
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:27,214
[Reporter] 很有气势！但听说你的队友克劳也参赛了，你们会互相让吗？
{Camera:Static|position=3.7,1.85,-48.1|lookAt=5.75,1.08,-50.8}

5
00:00:27,514 --> 00:00:39,514
[Zorak] 让？在竞技场上，没有队长和队员，只有...五个同时卡在同一个栏架上的倒霉蛋。不过放心，我会第一个卡住的，给大家做个示范。
{Zorak}{FaceSmirk}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Zorak}{CrossArms}
{Camera:Static|position=1.7,1.75,-48.4|lookAt=-1.83,1.05,-50.7}

6
00:00:39,814 --> 00:00:43,582
[Reporter] 好现实的队长！接下来是鳞甲战士克劳！
{Klaw}{SurprisedJump}
{Klaw}{FaceExcited}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=3.7,1.85,-48.1|lookAt=5.75,1.08,-50.8}

7
00:00:43,882 --> 00:00:54,850
[Klaw] 哈哈！队长说要跨越边界？我倒是担心他那些"优雅"的跨栏动作会不会被栏架反弹打到脸！不过没关系，我已经准备好拍照了！
{Klaw}{FaceHappy}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{Klaw}{HandsOnHips}
{Camera:Static|position=2.7,1.75,-48.2|lookAt=-0.61,1.05,-50.7}

8
00:00:55,150 --> 00:00:59,230
[Reporter] 看来队内氛围很欢乐啊！克劳，你的优势是什么？
{Klaw}{FightingStance}
{Klaw}{FaceDetermined}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=3.7,1.85,-48.1|lookAt=5.75,1.08,-50.8}

9
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:08,818
[Klaw] 我的鳞甲可不是摆设！撞翻栏架？不，我会用肩膀把它们...顶成现代艺术品！然后卖给博物馆换零花钱！
{Klaw}{FaceHappy}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=whoosh_fast}
{Camera:Static|position=2.7,1.75,-48.2|lookAt=-0.61,1.05,-50.7}

10
00:01:09,118 --> 00:01:13,198
[Reporter] 太有创意了...接下来是维克斯，队伍里唯一的飞行成员！
{Vex}{WaveHand}
{Vex}{FaceHappy}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=3.7,1.85,-48.1|lookAt=5.75,1.08,-50.8}

11
00:01:13,498 --> 00:01:19,690
[Vex] 其实我本来不想来的...但他们说如果参加了，可以免洗三个月的飞船餐盘。
{Vex}{Shrug}
{Vex}{FaceSmirk}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=3.7,1.8,-48.1|lookAt=0.61,1.08,-50.7}

12
00:01:19,990 --> 00:01:24,526
[Reporter] 就为了这个？！维克斯，你会用翅膀...保持平衡吗？
{Vex}{FaceSurprised}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{Vex}{HandsUp}
{Camera:Static|position=3.7,1.85,-48.1|lookAt=5.75,1.08,-50.8}

13
00:01:24,826 --> 00:01:32,578
[Vex] 当然！我的翅膀只是...只是用来保持平衡的！绝对不是为了...飞得比别人高一点点！
{Vex}{FaceHappy}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{Vex}{Shrug}
{SFX:Play|name=wind_gentle}
{Camera:Static|position=3.7,1.8,-48.1|lookAt=0.61,1.08,-50.7}

14
00:01:32,878 --> 00:01:37,582
[Reporter] 好的好的，我们相信你...大概。接下来是晶体守护者雷克斯！
{Rex}{CrossArms}
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=3.7,1.85,-48.1|lookAt=5.75,1.08,-50.8}

15
00:01:37,882 --> 00:01:45,082
[Rex] 这些外星人非要拉我来。我说过我更喜欢站着不动...但站着跨栏好像也行。
{Rex}{FaceDetermined}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Rex}{HandsOnHips}
{Camera:Static|position=4.8,1.8,-48.2|lookAt=1.83,1.08,-50.7}

16
00:01:45,382 --> 00:01:47,302
[Reporter] 那你为什么要参赛？
{Rex}{Think}
{Rex}{FaceConfused}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=3.7,1.85,-48.1|lookAt=5.75,1.08,-50.8}

17
00:01:47,602 --> 00:01:56,386
[Rex] ...他们答应如果我参加了，就把飞船驾驶舱的椅子换成水晶的。输赢不重要，椅子重要。
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Rex}{LookAround}
{Camera:Static|position=4.8,1.8,-48.2|lookAt=1.83,1.08,-50.7}

18
00:01:56,686 --> 00:02:02,110
[Reporter] 水晶椅子？！最后，让我们欢迎来自虫虫迪厅的迪斯科虫虫！
{DiscoWorm}{FaceHappy}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=3.7,1.85,-48.1|lookAt=5.75,1.08,-50.8}

19
00:02:02,410 --> 00:02:08,194
[DiscoWorm] 今晚不跨栏，跑道不准完！低音开满，虫王上场！栏架们准备好了吗？
{DiscoWorm}{FaceSurprised}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=energy_blast|volume=0.4}
{Camera:Static|position=5.4,2.0,-48.0|lookAt=3.05,0.85,-50.7}

20
00:02:08,494 --> 00:02:11,662
[Reporter] 虫虫，你没有腿，怎么跨栏？
{DiscoWorm}{FaceHappy}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=3.7,1.85,-48.1|lookAt=5.75,1.08,-50.8}

21
00:02:11,962 --> 00:02:19,666
[DiscoWorm] 蠕动就是我的跨栏！栏架？我直接从下面钻过去！规则没说不能钻吧？钻洞也是技术活！
{DiscoWorm}{FaceSurprised}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=whoosh_fast|volume=0.5}
{Camera:Static|position=5.4,2.0,-48.0|lookAt=3.05,0.85,-50.7}

22
00:02:19,766 --> 00:02:19,866
{Camera:RaceSideTrack|sideX=-16.0|height=2.15|lookAtY=0.95|trackWidth=8.5|frameDepth=38|leaderBias=0.52|fov=74|duration=59.2|racers=Zorak,Klaw,Vex,Rex,DiscoWorm}

23
00:02:19,966 --> 00:02:20,766
{Camera:Static|position=-7.4,1.55,-36.28|lookAt=-0.35,1.05,-36.28|duration=1.1}

24
00:02:20,866 --> 00:02:28,282
[Reporter] 钻...钻过去？！裁判！这算犯规吗？！算了不管了！各就各位——
{Position:Reporter|x=7.2|z=-51.8|face=forward}
{Position:Zorak|x=-1.83|z=-50.5|face=forward}
{Position:Klaw|x=-0.61|z=-50.5|face=forward}
{Position:Vex|x=0.61|z=-50.5|face=forward}
{Position:Rex|x=1.83|z=-50.5|face=forward}
{Position:DiscoWorm|x=3.05|z=-50.5|face=forward}
