{Klaw}{Crouch|level=deep}
{Vex}{Crouch|level=deep}
{Rex}{Crouch|level=deep}
{DiscoWorm}{WormWiggle|duration=2.0}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceHappy}
{Camera:Static|position=8.8,2.4,-55.8|lookAt=1.5,0.85,-50.2}

25
00:02:28,382 --> 00:02:30,158
