26
00:02:30,258 --> 00:02:34,842
{Zorak}{CrouchJump|height=1.85|duration=0.9|arms=balance}
{Klaw}{CrouchJump|height=1.45|duration=0.8|arms=guard}
{Vex}{CrouchJump|height=2.05|duration=1.0|arms=balance}
{Zorak}{FaceDetermined}
{SFX:Play|name=dash_whoosh}
[Zorak] 第一个栏！看我的！队长先给你们打个样！
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Zorak|x=-1.83|fromZ=-39.0|z=-25.5|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.85|action=Run|frequency=4.1|legLift=high|arms=balance}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Klaw|x=-0.61|fromZ=-39.0|z=-25.5|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.45|action=Run|frequency=3.8|legLift=high|arms=guard}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Vex|x=0.61|fromZ=-39.0|z=-25.5|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=2.05|action=Run|frequency=4.0|legLift=high|arms=balance}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Rex|x=1.83|fromZ=-39.0|z=-25.5|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.55|action=Run|frequency=2.8|legLift=mid|arms=reach}
{Event:Move|character=DiscoWorm|x=3.05|z=-43.0|duration=3.0|action=WormTunnel}

27
00:02:34,942 --> 00:02:40,030
{Klaw}{DashForward|duration=0.7}
{Klaw}{CrouchJump|height=1.45|duration=0.8|arms=guard}
{Klaw}{FaceDetermined}
{SFX:Play|name=impact_thud}
[Klaw] 队长跳过去了？那我也得跟上！看我的鳞甲冲锋！
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Zorak|x=-1.83|fromZ=-25.5|z=-8.8|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.85|action=Run|frequency=4.1|legLift=high|arms=balance}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Klaw|x=-0.61|fromZ=-25.5|z=-8.0|duration=3.2|jumpHeight=1.45|action=Run|frequency=4.2|legLift=high|arms=guard}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Vex|x=0.61|fromZ=-25.5|z=-9.5|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=2.15|action=Run|frequency=4.0|legLift=high|arms=balance}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Rex|x=1.83|fromZ=-25.5|z=-8.8|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.55|action=Run|frequency=2.8|legLift=mid|arms=reach}
{Event:Move|character=DiscoWorm|x=3.05|z=-36.0|duration=3.0|action=WormTunnel}

28
00:02:40,130 --> 00:02:44,522
{Zorak}{CrouchJump|height=1.85|duration=0.9|arms=balance}
{Vex}{CrouchJump|height=2.2|duration=1.0|arms=balance}
{Zorak}{FaceHappy}
{SFX:Play|name=whoosh_fast}
[Zorak] 完美跨越！看来队长的示范很成功嘛！
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Zorak|x=-1.83|fromZ=-8.8|z=9.5|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.85|action=Run|frequency=4.2|legLift=high|arms=balance}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Klaw|x=-0.61|fromZ=-8.0|z=7.5|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.45|action=Run|frequency=3.8|legLift=high|arms=guard}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Vex|x=0.61|fromZ=-9.5|z=10.0|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=2.2|action=Run|frequency=4.0|legLift=high|arms=balance}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Rex|x=1.83|fromZ=-8.8|z=9.5|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.55|action=Run|frequency=2.7|legLift=mid|arms=reach}
{Event:Move|character=DiscoWorm|x=3.05|z=-30.0|duration=3.0|action=WormTunnel}

29
00:02:44,622 --> 00:02:52,062
{Vex}{CrouchJump|height=2.7|duration=1.2|arms=balance}
{Vex}{FlyPose}
{Vex}{FaceHappy}
{SFX:Play|name=wind_gentle}
[Vex] 哇！飞起来了——不是！是跳起来了！真的只是跳！风太大而已！
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Zorak|x=-1.83|fromZ=9.5|z=28.0|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.85|action=Run|frequency=4.2|legLift=high|arms=balance}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Klaw|x=-0.61|fromZ=7.5|z=21.0|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.45|action=Run|frequency=3.4|legLift=mid|arms=guard}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Vex|x=0.61|fromZ=10.0|z=28.0|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=2.7|action=Run|frequency=4.0|legLift=high|arms=balance}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Rex|x=1.83|fromZ=9.5|z=28.0|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.55|action=Run|frequency=2.7|legLift=mid|arms=reach}
{Event:Move|character=DiscoWorm|x=3.05|z=-22.0|duration=3.0|action=WormTunnel}

30
00:02:52,162 --> 00:03:00,178
{Rex}{CrouchJump|height=1.55|duration=1.0|arms=reach}
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{SFX:Play|name=energy_blast|volume=0.3}
[Rex] 而且，我可以把栏架变成水晶滑梯。虽然滑下去可能不太符合规则。
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Zorak|x=-1.83|fromZ=28.0|z=40.0|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.85|action=Run|frequency=4.0|legLift=high|arms=balance}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Klaw|x=-0.61|fromZ=21.0|z=31.0|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.45|action=Run|frequency=3.2|legLift=mid|arms=guard}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Vex|x=0.61|fromZ=28.0|z=39.0|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=2.2|action=Run|frequency=3.8|legLift=high|arms=balance}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Rex|x=1.83|fromZ=28.0|z=40.0|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.55|action=Run|frequency=2.7|legLift=mid|arms=reach}
{Event:Move|character=DiscoWorm|x=3.05|z=-12.0|duration=3.0|action=WormTunnel}

31
00:03:00,278 --> 00:03:05,942
{Zorak}{CrouchJump|height=1.85|duration=0.9|arms=balance}
{Zorak}{FaceAngry}
{SFX:Play|name=dash_whoosh}
[Zorak] 最后冲刺！冠军是我的！队员们加油啊，别掉队太远！
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Zorak|x=-1.83|fromZ=40.0|z=60.0|duration=6.0|jumpHeight=1.9|action=Run|frequency=4.3|legLift=high|arms=balance}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Klaw|x=-0.61|fromZ=31.0|z=43.0|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.45|action=Run|frequency=3.2|legLift=mid|arms=guard}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Vex|x=0.61|fromZ=39.0|z=48.0|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=2.4|action=Run|frequency=3.6|legLift=high|arms=balance}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Rex|x=1.83|fromZ=40.0|z=60.0|duration=3.0|jumpHeight=1.55|action=Run|frequency=2.7|legLift=mid|arms=reach}
{Event:Move|character=DiscoWorm|x=3.05|z=0.0|duration=4.0|action=WormTunnel}

32
00:03:06,042 --> 00:03:12,978
{Klaw}{CrouchJump|height=0.72|duration=0.8|arms=guard}
{Klaw}{FacePain}
{Klaw}{FXHitSpark}
{Klaw}{HitStagger|duration=0.7}
{SFX:Play|name=impact_thud}
[Klaw] 哎呀！最后一个栏架反弹打中我的脸了！队长你看，我帮你测试了栏架的弹性！
{Event:KnockHurdle|character=Klaw|x=-0.61|z=45.98|offset=2.85|duration=0.55|direction=forward}
{Event:HurdleRun|character=Klaw|x=-0.61|fromZ=43.0|z=60.0|duration=18.0|jumpHeight=0.72|collision=knockdown|action=Run|frequency=2.2|legLift=low|arms=guard}
