{Event:Move|character=DiscoWorm|x=3.05|z=18.5|duration=3.0|action=WormTunnel}

38
00:03:41,308 --> 00:03:46,612
{DiscoWorm}{WormTunnel|duration=3.0}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceSurprised}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=whoosh_fast|volume=0.5}
[DiscoWorm] 哎呀！卡住了！屁股太圆了！早知道昨天不吃那么多土了！
{Event:Move|character=DiscoWorm|x=3.05|z=42.0|duration=5.0|action=WormTunnel}

39
00:03:46,712 --> 00:03:51,824
{Zorak}{Celebrate}
{Zorak}{FaceDetermined}
[Zorak] 冲线！我是第一！队长就是队长，没办法！
{SFX:Play|name=dash_whoosh}

40
00:03:51,924 --> 00:03:57,252
{Vex}{FacePain}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=fall_whistle}
[Vex] 救命啊！我飞过终点线了！我就说...风太大了嘛！

41
00:03:57,352 --> 00:04:03,568
{DiscoWorm}{WormTunnel|duration=3.0}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceHappy}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceBlink}
[DiscoWorm] 蠕动到终点！虽然是从最后一个栏架下面钻出来的！但规则没说不能钻啊！
{Event:Move|character=DiscoWorm|x=3.05|z=60.0|duration=2.8|action=WormTunnel}

42
00:04:03,668 --> 00:04:07,676
[Reporter] 冠军是——泽拉克！用时13秒58！
{Zorak}{HandsOnHips}
{Zorak}{FaceHappy}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Zorak}{WaveHand}
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.8,58.4|lookAt=0,1.08,55}

43
00:04:07,776 --> 00:04:13,258
{Position:Zorak|x=-3|z=45|face=camera}
{Position:Klaw|x=-1.5|z=43|face=camera}
{Position:Vex|x=1.5|z=44|face=camera}
{Position:Rex|x=3|z=42|face=camera}
{Position:DiscoWorm|x=0|z=38|face=camera}
{Event:Move|character=DiscoWorm|x=0|y=0|z=38|duration=0.1|action=WormWiggle}
{Zorak}{FaceHappy}
{Klaw}{FaceHappy}
{Vex}{FaceHappy}
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceHappy}
[Reporter] 这就是第一届星际跨栏大赛！感谢所有选手！我们下次再见！
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.8,58.4|lookAt=0,1.08,55}

44
00:04:13,358 --> 00:04:22,694
[Zorak] 我说过，未知星系的边界，我都会跨越——包括那个差点把我绊倒的。队长嘛，总得有点狼狈的时候。
{Zorak}{HandsOnHips}
{Zorak}{FaceHappy}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Zorak}{WaveHand}
{Camera:Static|position=-3,1.85,48.4|lookAt=-3,1.08,45}

45
00:04:22,794 --> 00:04:28,530
[Reporter] 亚军是...维克斯！虽然她是飞过去的，但裁判说翅膀不算犯规！
{Vex}{FaceSurprised}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{Vex}{Shrug}
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.8,58.4|lookAt=0,1.08,55}

46
00:04:28,630 --> 00:04:33,382
[Vex] 我就说翅膀只是保持平衡的...风太大是意外，意外！
{Vex}{FaceSurprised}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{Vex}{Shrug}
{Camera:Static|position=1.5,1.9,47.4|lookAt=1.5,1.12,44}

47
00:04:33,482 --> 00:04:37,826
[Reporter] 季军是雷克斯！虽然最慢，但也是最优雅的！
{Rex}{CrossArms}
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Rex}{Nod}
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.8,58.4|lookAt=0,1.08,55}

48
00:04:37,926 --> 00:04:45,054
[Rex] 水晶从不匆忙。但水晶椅子可以快点到吗？我已经想好放哪了。
{Rex}{CrossArms}
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Rex}{Nod}
{Camera:Static|position=3,1.9,45.4|lookAt=3,1.12,42}

49
00:04:45,154 --> 00:04:48,754
[Reporter] 克劳第四名...因为被反弹的栏架打中了脸。
{Klaw}{FacePain}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{Klaw}{ScratchHead}
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.8,58.4|lookAt=0,1.08,55}

50
00:04:48,854 --> 00:04:55,358
[Klaw] 那个栏架不讲武德...但我原谅它了，毕竟它现在是个现代艺术品。有人要合影吗？
{Klaw}{FacePain}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{Klaw}{ScratchHead}
{Camera:Static|position=-1.5,1.85,46.3|lookAt=-1.5,1.08,43}

51
00:04:55,458 --> 00:05:01,050
[Reporter] 最后一名是迪斯科虫虫...因为卡在倒数第二个栏架下面，被工作人员拔出来的。
{DiscoWorm}{FaceSurprised}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.8,58.4|lookAt=0,1.08,55}

52
00:05:01,150 --> 00:05:08,974
[DiscoWorm] 下次我要在栏架上装迪斯科球！这样它们就会自己转开！或者被我晃晕！反正总有一个办法能过去！
{DiscoWorm}{FaceSurprised}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=0,2.0,46.2|lookAt=0,0.85,42.5}

53
00:05:09,074 --> 00:05:12,574
{Zorak}{Walk}
{Klaw}{Walk}
{Vex}{Walk}
{Rex}{Walk}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceHappy}
{Event:Move|character=Zorak|x=-3|z=48|duration=2.5}
{Event:Move|character=Klaw|x=3|z=46|duration=2.5}
{Event:Move|character=Vex|x=0|z=47|duration=2.5}
{Event:Move|character=Rex|x=0|z=45|duration=2.5}
{Transition:Fade|duration=2.0}
{Camera:Static|position=0,4.8,60|lookAt=0,1,45}

54
00:05:12,674 --> 00:05:21,602
{Zorak}{ReachOut}
{Zorak}{FaceHappy}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
[Zorak] 走吧，队员们。回去洗餐盘了——维克斯，你的三个月免洗取消了。不过别担心，我陪你一起洗！
{Camera:Static|position=-3,1.85,48.4|lookAt=-3,1.08,45}

55
00:05:21,702 --> 00:05:25,998
{Vex}{FacePain}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{Vex}{Shrug}
[Vex] 我就知道...但至少队长陪我一起洗，不算太惨！
{Camera:Static|position=1.5,1.9,47.4|lookAt=1.5,1.12,44}

56
00:05:26,098 --> 00:05:32,338
{Klaw}{FaceHappy}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{Klaw}{WaveHand}
[Klaw] 至少我不用洗！因为我根本没赢到任何东西！等等，这算好事吗？
{Camera:Static|position=-1.5,1.85,46.3|lookAt=-1.5,1.08,43}

57
00:05:32,438 --> 00:05:37,334
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Rex}{CrossArms}
[Rex] 我的水晶椅子...应该已经在路上了吧？对吧？
{Camera:Static|position=3,1.9,45.4|lookAt=3,1.12,42}

58
00:05:37,434 --> 00:05:44,514
{DiscoWorm}{FaceHappy}
{DiscoWorm}{FaceBlink}
[DiscoWorm] 没关系！下次我办一个"栏架下钻洞大赛"！保证我第一！规则我来定，第一条：必须没腿！
{SFX:Play|name=energy_blast|volume=0.3}
{Camera:Static|position=0,2.0,46.2|lookAt=0,0.85,42.5}

59
00:05:44,614 --> 00:05:47,374
{Position:Reporter|x=0|z=55|face=camera}
[Reporter] 星际跨栏大赛，圆满结束！
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.8,58.4|lookAt=0,1.08,55}
